# steal. In the temple (3001), which isn't a safe room: Pickpocket (13, a thief in clan rom, steal at 95%), Yeoman (5,
# rom: 8 levels below, so is_safe lets Pickpocket try and steal's own 7-level rule fails it), Clansman (20, rom), Seer
# (20, in no clan, so is_safe refuses), Decimus (10, a warrior in no clan, who can't steal) and Smokegod. The mayor
# (3143) sleeps, so stealing from him always works at 95% (the roll drops by 10). Pickpocket gives him 30 gold to take
# back, and Smokegod gives him leather pants (3062), a meat cleaver (1355, level 17: too high), a strange amulet (307,
# no drop) and a mob's corpse (10, 1000 weight), which Pickpocket, already carrying two, can't hold. By the altar
# (3054, a safe room) stealing from a mob is refused. A failed steal makes Pickpocket a THIEF and is saved. Last,
# Unseen (5, invisible, in no clan) fails to steal from an awake fido, which can't see it and attacks (fight.c's
# multi_hit): one round, as only area_update runs. Before that, Pickpocket's own charmed fido, ordered to sleep, has no coins
# to steal; Unseen tries the second, awake fido.
@connect pick
Pickpocket
psswrd
@return
@connect yeo
Yeoman
psswrd
@return
@connect clan
Clansman
psswrd
@return
@connect seer
Seer
psswrd
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@mob 3143 3001
@as pick
steal
steal coins
steal coins nobody
steal coins pickpocket
steal coins seer
@state
steal coins mayor
@pulse 24
steal gold mayor
@pulse 24
give 30 gold mayor
steal coins mayor
@pulse 24
@obj 3062 3001
@obj 1355 3001
@obj 307 3001
@obj 10 3001
@obj 10 3001
@obj 10 3001
@as god
get pants
get cleaver
get amulet
get corpse
give pants mayor
give cleaver mayor
give amulet mayor
give corpse mayor
@as pick
steal pants mayor
@pulse 24
steal nothing mayor
@pulse 24
steal cleaver mayor
@pulse 24
steal amulet mayor
@pulse 24
get all.corpse
steal corpse mayor
@pulse 24
@state
@as yeo
sleep
@as pick
steal coins yeoman
@pulse 24
@file ../player/Pickpocket
steal coins clansman
@pulse 24
steal coins clansman
@pulse 24
north
@pulse 1
steal coins healer
@state
south
@pulse 1
@mob 3062 3001
@charm
order fido sleep
@pulse 12
steal coins fido
@pulse 24
@mob 3062 3001
@connect unseen
Unseen
psswrd
@return
@return
steal coins fido
